{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辛酉歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壬申年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉簡文帝咸安\n二年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夏六月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時高勾麗都在平壤東黃城。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小獸林四年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "建元十年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春二月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東晉孝武時。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉孝武大元十八年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋八月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南齊廢帝時。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋七月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋廢帝三年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初，長壽王陰謀百濟，求可以間諜者。浮屠道琳應募而徃，與蓋鹵王圍棊，\n因勸築城起宮室，使人民究困。於是道琳還告之，王發兵圍漢城，克之。百濟移都熊津"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁簡文帝二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初，居漆夫祝髮為僧，西覘勾麗，聞惠亮法師開堂說經，遂詣聽講，與之密\n約。至是年，居漆夫伐勾麗，取法師同載而歸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐高祖武德八年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐貞觀十六年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐高宗永徽元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老子道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新羅大山縣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "源流作普依，字智法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐高宗總章元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓋蘇文之子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉孝武大元九年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋七月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今廣州。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春二月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁武帝之時。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自枕流王元年下至聖王元年，為百四十年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂春川"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂摩騰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳見下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康居國人，行化于吳主孫權之國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋文帝開皇十九年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二\n月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春正月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是年法王薨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐貞觀八年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春二月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即武王。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐永徽六年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即顯慶五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夏五月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺僧皆見，若有舟楫隨大水入寺門。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熊津城"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其左道屬于新羅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐開元七年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今益山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋七月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今金溝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌勒寺乃知命法師所創，見佛\n祖源流"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劉宋時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今美山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時梁遣使賜香，羣臣不知所用。墨胡子見之曰：此所以達誠於三寶。時王女病革，王使胡子焚香表誓，病\n尋愈。王餽贈厚，胡子出見，毛禮以所得物贈之，俄而不知所歸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "駿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即焰知麻立干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作我道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金富軾云：此據金大問雞林雜傳所記書之也。奭韓奈麻金用行所\n\n撰我道和尚󳬴所錄殊異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊高帝建元元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁武帝大通二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云處道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲子年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁武帝大同十年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春二月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高麗真靜國師天頙作興輪寺大鍾，銘云：青丘佛法，始興於茲寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁武帝末年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新羅僧入學于中國者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真興王十年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辛未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已見上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王城東"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見本紀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祭祀志云：靈廟\n寺南行五里祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一云寺主真興王以\n惠亮法師為之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真興王以\n寶良法師為之，真德王加一人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元聖王以惠英、梵如二法師為之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上疑在慶州地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又陝川清涼寺、智異山雙溪寺，見崔孤雲傳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今原州。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又弓裔於興教寺祝髮，王昌瑾於勃颯寺，見鎮星塑傳，皆新羅古寺也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳文帝天嘉六年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是年秋王薨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真平王七年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳後主至德三年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是年陳氏滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真平十八年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋文帝開皇十六年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真平十二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "還去\n加悉寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上軍亦人\n名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦僧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋煬帝大\n業元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善德\n十二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春三月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐總章二\n年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "官名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時勾麗新亡，法安為勾麗人所殺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐儀鳳元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在順興"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是年秋，王卒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又聖德王十四年，召河西州龍鳴嶽居士理曉，祈雨於泉林寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐武后長壽元年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐武后長安三年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐代宗廣德元年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "官名\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在晉州。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐德宗貞元廿八年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋八月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐憲宗元和五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐文宗太和元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此時勾麗已亡，\n丘德盖西土之人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐宣宗大中五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐僖宗文德元年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後唐時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後唐明宗天成四年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夏六月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與金庾信同時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姓崔氏，即孤雲之兄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即賢俊之友"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居星州一\n利縣，為母刲股"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為弓裔所殺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金庾信之妻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平安道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上專據金富軾三\n國史為信文，他書所出，別錄于下方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新羅景德王十五年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南嶽讓禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見第六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西堂藏禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西堂藏禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "麻谷徹禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "崔孤雲󳬴文見下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "章敬〔憚〕禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "源流稱鳳林玄昱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "章敬〔憚〕禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第九卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南泉願禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鹽官齊安禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "源流云剏三陟三和寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大梅常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案：此是長〔與〕寶林寺所祖迦智山道儀大師也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大梅常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即新興寺冲彥禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗智常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第十卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仰山寂禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "案：此即萬法歸一之意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仰山寂禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第十二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石霜諸禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "源流〔云〕敬懷暉法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石霜諸禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石霜諸禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石霜諸禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第十六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洞山价禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九峯䖍禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲盖元禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "谷山藏禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第十七卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居膺禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即照通和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居膺禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居膺禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長慶稜禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上見第十八\n卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白兆圓禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見第二十三卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見拈頌第二十六卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泊巖又因僧問：如何\n是道？師云：徒勞車馬跡。○又因僧問：如何是教？師云：貝葉收不盡。○丹霞頌文今刪之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達摩諡圓覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武烈王八代孫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即香山白樂天之空門友"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見上傳燈錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "景文王十一年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僖宗丙申"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真聖王二年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔在公州聖住寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "少乘法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石順興"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寂照塔鉻云：智澄大師就學于浮石山，即石澄大德也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔銘又有詢，又圓藏、靈源、玄影等四人，得其清淨之法。僧亮、普慎、心光等三人，皆無\n染之門人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在慶州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太子時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此唐\n懿宗咸通年間人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "咸通\n六年事。○󳬴文又云：釋門二傑，曰賢諒、神解，督其事。○源流云：決言與順應剏海印寺于伽耶山。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐〔移〕宗年號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：長慶五年己巳，道義行化楓岳、雪岳，至文德二\n年己酉。○慈弘案：道義大師，寶林之先德也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：陟師法嗣德興大王、宣康太子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去中國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：靜眾在唐玄宗，禮敬\n殊甚。柳宗元起影堂，李商隱為󳬴銘。其門人無住，亦名僧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注見下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禪譜云：黃梅子，金生石也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：馬和尚，字慧覺，金雲卿之弟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即道義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即洪陟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無可考"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智力，寺名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即慧炤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忠彥，見傳燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺體，見傳燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：玄昱、覺休，即鹽官安法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即覺\n雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "品日，見傳燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即無染"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注云：惠雲，即無染嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󳬴在谷城相裏寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寂照本智\n證之塔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即法師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即禪師。○塔在曦陽山鳳\n岩寺，而賢溪山安樂寺，師所甞居也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道信之旁出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四祖號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂智證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四祖銘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂法朗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦金姓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔銘又云：門人性蠲、敏休、楊子\n孚、繼徹等咸得鳳尾。○又云：門人英爽來促受辛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󳬴在智異山雙溪寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "馬祖之旁傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文宗庚戌年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魚山梵唄，即師之遺音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧昭，一作慧炤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寂照塔註云：憲德王十三年，北宗神行先導，南宗道義繼\n主。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已見上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴宗主以石髑髏十餘板為其徒講論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高麗平章事幹文俊撰󳬴銘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長興寶林寺先德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廉居法嗣，名體真，姓金氏，熊津人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熊川人，行真大師法嗣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智音大師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞遇賊六十餘人，作歌化之，賊皆落髮為徒，同入智異山，不復跡世。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名勝妙󳬴，在原州玄溪山居須寺，高麗崔冲撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󳬴在昌原鳳林寺，新羅兵部侍郎崔仁衷撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󳬴在光陽玉龍寺，高麗崔惟清撰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名度甫，姓金氏，靈岩人。󳬴在光陽玉龍寺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剏建表訓寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剏建邊山來蘇寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剏建寶光寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剏建寶賢寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剏建美黃寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居芭蕉寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居雙峯寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居五臺山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居金山寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑亦金山寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居天冠山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居佛岬寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居喬僧寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居喬僧寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甞居法住寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐懿宗咸通五年生，照宗大順二年入中國，天\n祐二年重修基北，石晉開運三年立󳬴。○無為寺，在康津。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱延壽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即開寶八年乙亥。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "史云：王崇奉緇流，以為師傅。自是以後，子孫相承，世為家法，多創寺剎。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223001 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "憚疑暉次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223002", "type": "orig", "text": "與疑興"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223003", "type": "orig", "text": "云下疑脫章字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224001", "type": "orig", "text": "王疑玉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0224002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0224002", "type": "orig", "text": "移疑穆"}
